window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>GET YOUR POST APOCALYPTIC ON!!!! BOOK 5 OF THE BEST SELLING SERIES NOCTURNE!!!!! OVER 11 MILLION KU PAGES READ IN THE SERIES!!!!</b><br> <br> The Second Challenge is pushing them to the brink of losing all they hold dear, Dungeons, and they must be conquered or they all will unleash their denizens across the entire World of Erebus. Bronze Dungeons are what's on the table and they seem beyond what they can tackle but do so they must, at only Iron, and it will take cooperation amongst allies and enemies both. They know they will need one eye open for treachery hangs upon the edge of every path Gideon can see. The cost will be higher than he'd ever want or choose. People were going to die, it was inevitable. <br> <br> The Prime Avatar of the System hovers over his shoulder, the Iron Lord has multiple aces up his sleeve between the Blood King and his undead now enslaved to the Iron Church and through them, the Sanctum. Julia Langston, one of the few friends Gideon Sho had ever made from the Old World, and she is another hooked to the chains of the long and malicious reach of the Iron Church. Dikembe Solomon thinks he has the Warcrow pinned but the Umbral Savage has shown, he will never give up, regardless the odds, and he has some hidden cards of his own and two of the most powerful Gods in the Multi-Verse behind him and L'Sana.<br> <br> Get your seat belt tight and clicked, the popcorn on fingertips and your shots of tequila cut to drop. The ride is gonna be a whirlwind of chaos, cost and corpses. They will be tested, they will bleed and someone will end up paying the ultimate price. Be Ready and....</p> <p><b>GET YOUR POST APOCALYPTIC ON!!!!!</b></p>"; 
